          "url": "https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-multi-agent-orchestration-chat-on-agentcore/blob/b48bcb476d08383f9d9b65a5df046555d7ba0fbb/README.md#L62-L70"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7ff60f6a3e4b3812f5029fc7e1a3a24c6e3ddbc6a3f05b039fed2159540739e1"
      ],
      "text": "The stack includes a React SPA frontend on CloudFront+S3, Cognito JWT auth, an Express.js API on Lambda/API Gateway, DynamoDB+S3 storage, AppSync Events WebSocket, and EventBridge scheduling."
    },
