  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The product is a multi-agent platform for creating, customizing, and sharing AI agents across an organization, built on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore. The stack includes a React SPA frontend on CloudFront+S3, Cognito JWT auth, an Express.js API on Lambda/API Gateway, DynamoDB+S3 storage, AppSync Events WebSocket, and EventBridge scheduling.",
